#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
gw — LLM Gateway helper
========================
Usage:
    gw                         Show status of all components + key paths
    gw health [--json]         Probe each endpoint's health route (exit 1 if any down)
    gw start <component>       Start a component (or "all")
    gw stop <component>        Stop a component (or "all")
    gw restart <component>     Restart a component (or "all" for full teardown + restart)
    gw logs <component>        Tail logs for a component
    gw uninstall               Deregister all autostart, stop containers

Components:
    all            Every enabled component (full teardown/restart in safe order)
    management     Gateway management service (llmgateway.py / launchd)
    <service>      Host model server run by management (local, whisper-large,
                   kokoro, laya, … — see `gw` status)
    docker         Entire Docker Compose stack
    litellm        LiteLLM proxy container
    postgres       PostgreSQL container
    open-webui     Open WebUI chat front-end container
    grafana        Grafana dashboards container
    prometheus     Prometheus metrics container
    loki           Loki log aggregation container
    alloy          Grafana Alloy collector container
    hermes-dashboard  Hermes agent dashboard (standalone container, not in compose)

Console output: clean, no timestamps. Warnings in yellow, errors in red.
Log file: <data_dir>/logs/gw.log — full timestamps, overwritten each run.
"""

